# Experiment data is never versioned as loose files (Constitution, Principle II).
# The only exceptions are the packaged dataset, and the packaged mutants and test suites (SLM, GPT,
# Gemini, Claude) of the final run (amendment 1.6.0), and the statement blocks of the original Codeforces
# pages (check-statements); what day-to-day development generates stays under data/mutants/,
# data/suites/ and data/statements/, ignored.
data/*
!data/dataset.zip
!data/mutants.zip
!data/slm_suites.zip
!data/gpt_suites.zip
!data/gemini_suites.zip
!data/claude_suites.zip
!data/statement_originals.zip
# Revision 1 of the dataset, kept for audit after revision 2 (constitution 1.8.0, Principle II).
!data/dataset.rev1.zip

# Secrets: only .env.example is versioned.
.env

# Python and tool caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/

# Claude Code worktrees (not used by default in this project, Constitution Princípio X;
# ignored so a one-off worktree never shows up as noise in `git status`)
.claude/worktrees/
